{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04299","headline":"侍从过公主南宅侍宴探得风字应制 · 张易之","name":"侍从过公主南宅侍宴探得风字应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"逐赏平阳第，鸣笳上苑东。\n鸟吟千户竹，蝶舞百花丛。\n时攀小山桂，共挹大王风。\n坐客无劳起，秦箫曲未终。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张易之","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04299.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04299","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}